#TopoMap: A Feature-based Semantic Discriminator of the Topographical Regions in the Test Input Space

## Analysis of the responses obtained through the human study.

If you want to replicate the analysis on the MNIST dataset, run the following command in this folder:

$python3 analyze_results.py mnist

If you want to replicate the analysis on the CIFAR-10 dataset, run the following command in this folder:

$python3 analyze_results.py cifar10

